tan Stock Exchange of India Limited, NCDEX Limited and NSE Clearing Limited (“hereinafter referred to as Stock Exchanges/Clearing Corporation”), the shareholders.  &lt;BR&gt; 
 &lt;BR&gt; 
Accordingly, the Company has duly filed an application seeking approval of the Stock Exchanges / Clearing Corporation, as applicable, and the approvals are presently awaited.  &lt;BR&gt; 
 &lt;BR&gt; 
